@startuml
title Supply offer: the supplier and the contractor
[*] --> offered : supplier offers (150)
offered --> offered : supplier revises its price (151)
offered --> withdrawn : supplier withdraws (152)
offered --> accepted : contractor accepts (153)
offered --> declined : contractor declines (154)
offered -[dotted]-> accepted : supplier cannot accept its own offer (155)
withdrawn --> [*]
accepted --> [*]
declined --> [*]
@enduml
